{"t":"Troll Sabotage Quest","s":"troll-sabotage-quest-d8054","k":"quest","i":"assets/wiki/TrollSabotage_1_bbe7c8.png","q":1,"html":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" dir=\"ltr\" lang=\"en\"><div class=\"twbox\">\n<aside class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-twbox pi-layout-default\" role=\"region\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"name\">Troll Sabotage Quest</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">General</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"aka\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Aliases</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">None.</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"log\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Quest Log</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia%20Tales\">Tibia Tales</a></div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Requirements</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"premium\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Premium</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"yes-tick\" title=\"Yes\">✓</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"lvl\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Level</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">0<br/>(10 recommended)</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Other</h2>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"implemented\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8.20<br/><span class=\"implementation-date\">July 2, 2008<br/>Summer Update 2008</span></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"status\">\n<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Active</div>\n</div>\n</section>\n<nav class=\"pi-navigation pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-font\">See also: Quests</nav>\n</aside>\n<div id=\"w-quest-legend\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Legend\">Legend</span></h3>\n<p>The trolls destroyed the home of the poor <a href=\"#/wiki/Jerom\">Jerom</a>. And now when he planned to open a new store! You can help him to get revenge on the trolls who did this evil to him.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-dangers\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Dangers\">Dangers</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Bat\">Bats</a> and Wolves. Possibly lured <a href=\"#/wiki/Bear\">Bears</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Ghoul\">Ghouls</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Skeleton\">Skeletons</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Hunter\">Hunters</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Wisp\">Wisps</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Poacher\">Poachers</a>. If done during the night, you may also find <a href=\"#/wiki/Werebadger\">Werebadgers</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Wereboar\">Wereboars</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Werefox\">Werefoxes</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-reward\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Reward\">Reward</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Elvenhair%20Rope\">Elvenhair Rope</a> <b>or</b> 200gp and <a href=\"#/wiki/Jerom%27s%20Family%20Necklace\">Jerom's Family Necklace</a>.\n</p>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div id=\"w-quest-spoiler\">\n<div class=\"tw-cmd showhide-visible showhide-init quest-spoiler\" data-command=\"showhide-content\" data-showhide-value=\"visible\">\n<div class=\"showhide-header\" data-showhide-element=\"header\">Click to show/hide the quest spoiler.<br/><span style=\"font-size: 0.8em;\">(settings)</span></div>\n<div class=\"showhide-body\" data-showhide-element=\"body\">\n<div class=\"spoiler-pretext\">Spoiler • edit</div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Required_Equipment\">Required Equipment</span></h3>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Helmet%20of%20the%20Deep\">Helmet of the Deep</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Depth%20Galea\">Depth Galea</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Boots%20of%20Haste\">Boots of Haste</a></li></ul>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Method\">Method</span></h3>\n<p>Find <a href=\"#/wiki/Jerom\">Jerom</a> north-east of <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a> (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33239,31760,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33239, 31760, 7)</a>), near <a href=\"#/wiki/Avar%20Tar\">Avar Tar</a>.\n</p><p>Ask him about \"Mission\" and he will tell you about the troll who ruined his life.\n</p><p>Go to the other side of the mountain (<a class=\"coord-link\" data-coord=\"33236,31744,7\" title=\"Ver no mapa\">here (33236, 31744, 7)</a>) and jump into the river, put on your <a href=\"#/wiki/Helmet%20of%20the%20Deep\">Helmet of the Deep</a> or <a href=\"#/wiki/Depth%20Galea\">Depth Galea</a> and swim under the mountain.\n</p>\n<ul><li><b>You must have either helmet equipped in order to enter the mountain cave.</b></li></ul>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"TrollSabotage 1\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"243\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/TrollSabotage_1_bbe7c8.png\" width=\"261\"/></span><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"TrollSabotage 2\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"179\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/TrollSabotage_2_6a09c0.png\" width=\"230\"/></span><br/>\nYou should fall down a floor, swim to the water vortex and you are another floor down. Go out of the water and follow the way up as far as you can go. Walk immediately north from where the last set of stairs take you.\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"TrollSabotage Map\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"181\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/TrollSabotage_Map_1d760c.png\" width=\"454\"/></span><br/>\nyou will end up at the top of the mountain, wear your boots of haste and run the full distance in order to make the leap.<br/>\n<span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"TrollSabotage 3\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"149\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/TrollSabotage_3_8a0338.png\" width=\"233\"/></span><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><img alt=\"TrollSabotage 4\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"301\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/TrollSabotage_4_9b4075.png\" width=\"211\"/></span><br/>\n</p><p>Go up and you will find <a href=\"#/wiki/Chief%20Grarkharok\">Chief Grarkharok</a>, talk to him. \n</p><p>1. Threaten him with 'kill', 2. Offer him a 'lady', 3. Provide him the name of any female player on your server.\nHe will give you <a href=\"#/wiki/Jerom%27s%20Family%20Necklace\">Jerom's Family Necklace</a>.\n</p><p>Now Go back to <a href=\"#/wiki/Jerom\">Jerom</a> and ask him about <b>mission</b>.\n</p><p><b>Note that if you've lost your amulet and you talk to Jerom about your mission he will give you 200gp and will tell you that he got it.</b>\n</p><p>If you check your Quest Log, you can read that <a href=\"#/wiki/Chief%20Grarkharok\">Chief Grarkharok</a> is still waiting for a troll lady. Maybe there's another reward if you can help him.\n</p>\n<h4><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Further_information\">Further information</span></h4>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Jerom\">Jerom</a> will tell you about his dream to open up a <b>pet</b> store. and about his parent's <b>farm</b>. he will also tell you about varieties of pets (spider, snake, dog, rat, cat etc.)</li>\n<li><a href=\"#/wiki/Chief%20Grarkharok\">Chief Grarkharok</a> will tell you about his hobby of throwing <b>stones</b> at humans, and will also tell you about his love for <b>snakes</b> and <b>frogs</b> and will eat any dead frog or snake you will give him.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Transcripts\">Transcripts</span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a>, home of <a href=\"#/wiki/Jerom\">Jerom</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Hi</b><br/>\nJerom: Sorry, but I'm not in the best <b>mood</b> today.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Mission</b><br/>\nJerom: I'm not sure but I suppose that an evil troll lives in the mountains here! I saw him rummaging in the ruins of my house. ...<br/>\nJerom: I took a closer look and found my family casket ripped open. It contained a precious necklace. If I had it back, I could sell it and start over! ...<br/>\nJerom: Could you look for this mean beast, find out why he did and either get me some money ormy necklace to rebuild my business?<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>yes</b><br/>\nJerom: Gret! Finally, some light at the end of the tunnel! Come back and ask me for the <b>quest</b> when you solved this mystery!\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Troll Sabotage Quest</strong></span>\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Chief%20Grarkharok\">Chief Grarkharok</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Hi</b><br/>\nChief Grarkharok: Me Chief Grarkharok! No do nothing!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>kill you</b><br/>\nChief Grarkharok: Hrhrhrhr! Me no fear of human! Me Chief Grarkharok!!<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Lady</b><br/>\nChief Grarkharok: You help?? Human know troll lady for Grarkharok??<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Yes</b><br/>\nChief Grarkharok: What name of troll lady??<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: Say the name of your character or any character on your world.<br/>\nChief Grarkharok: <i>Character Name</i> ?!? Sound good! Bring troll lady to Grarkharok!! Here, give troll lady! Take take! Bring lady to Grarkharok for make tribe!! Now GO!<b><br/></b>\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Troll Sabotage Quest</strong></span>\n</p><p>Now you should have received <a href=\"#/wiki/Jerom%27s%20Family%20Necklace\">Jerom's Family Necklace</a>.\n</p>\n<ul><li><a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a>, home of <a href=\"#/wiki/Jerom\">Jerom</a></li></ul>\n<div class=\"desktop-only\"><table border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"npc_chat_div\" width=\"100%\"><tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t1\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:107px;\"><div class=\"t2\" style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:100%;\"><div class=\"t3\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td style=\"width:7px;\"><div class=\"t4\" style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr><tr class=\"m_tr\">\n<td class=\"m1\"></td>\n<td class=\"m2\" colspan=\"2\">\n<div class=\"m3\" style=\"overflow:auto;background:transparent;border:none;min-height:12px;height:100%;\">\n<p>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Hi</b><br/>\nJerom: Hello. Sorry, but I'm not in the best mood today.<br/>\n<i>Player</i>: <b>Mission</b><br/>\nJerom: Thank you sooo much &lt;sniffs&gt;. Well, you know I lost everything, but recently I found this strange rope here. I don't need it, here take it!<br/>\n<br/>\n</p></div>\n</td>\n<td class=\"m4\"></td>\n</tr><tr>\n<td class=\"b1\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b2\" style=\"width:107px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:107px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b3\" style=\"width:100%;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n<td class=\"b4\" style=\"width:7px;\"><div style=\"display:block;width:7px;height:24px;\"></div></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><span><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Troll Sabotage Quest</strong></span>\nYou will now receive the <a href=\"#/wiki/Elvenhair%20Rope\">Elvenhair Rope</a>.\n</p>\n<div class=\"messagebox\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><figure class=\"mw-halign-left\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"Go Forward Icon\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"25\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Go_Forward_Icon_f12cec.png\" width=\"25\"/></span><figcaption></figcaption></figure><p style=\"font-weight: bold;\">See also:</p><br/><p><a href=\"#/wiki/Tibia%20Tales\">Tibia Tales</a></p></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div></div></div></div>","quests":["threatened-dreams-quest"]}